### Project Vaidhya — edge-ai smoke tests (T1)
### VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client. T1 never opens a browser.

@base = http://localhost:8000
@visit = visit_demo_001

### health — must be green before anything else matters
GET {{base}}/health

### 1. start a session
POST {{base}}/session/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visit_id": "{{visit}}",
  "patient_id": "pat_001",
  "language": "ml"
}

### 2. pass-one vitals (the five the nurse enters)
POST {{base}}/vitals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visit_id": "{{visit}}",
  "phase": "pass_one_baseline",
  "readings": [
    { "type": "temperature",      "value_numeric": 38.1 },
    { "type": "blood_pressure",   "value_text": "118/76" },
    { "type": "pulse",            "value_numeric": 96 },
    { "type": "spo2",             "value_numeric": 97 },
    { "type": "respiratory_rate", "value_numeric": 18 }
  ]
}

### 3. one conversational turn
### Definition of done: a Malayalam audio file in, Malayalam bot audio out,
### plus an English transcript.
POST {{base}}/voice/turn
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----vaidhya

------vaidhya
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="visit_id"

{{visit}}
------vaidhya
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="turn.webm"
Content-Type: audio/webm

< ./samples/malayalam_turn.webm
------vaidhya--

### 4. poll state — this is where the nurse-finding machine resolves
GET {{base}}/session/{{visit}}/state

### 5. nurse answers the pending finding
POST {{base}}/vitals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visit_id": "{{visit}}",
  "phase": "on_demand",
  "readings": [
    { "type": "rebound_tenderness", "value_text": "true" }
  ]
}

### 6. finish — writes to Supabase AND publishes vaidhya/queue/new
POST {{base}}/intake/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{ "visit_id": "{{visit}}" }

### 7. doctor question without a broker (test convenience only)
POST {{base}}/consult/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visit_id": "{{visit}}",
  "question_en": "Does the pain get worse after eating?"
}
